• Coach the team in Agile values, Scrum principles, and effective ways of working, supporting greater autonomy, self-organization, and accountability;
• Facilitate and continuously improve Scrum events, including Sprint Planning, Daily Scrums, Sprint Reviews, Retrospectives, backlog refinement sessions, and cross-team alignment ceremonies;
