• Help the team maintain clear Sprint Goals and manage changes during the Sprint without losing focus on agreed priorities;
• Identify, track, communicate, and help remove impediments, delivery risks, and cross-team blockers;
• Facilitate coordination and information flow between the Mobile team and relevant stakeholders;
